msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian Network Analysis estimates the structure and strength of "
"conditional associations among variables in a graphical model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Analisis Jaringan Bayes mengestimasikan struktur dan kekuatan dari asosiasi "
"kondisional di antara variabel di model grafikal.\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The module supports the Gaussian graphical model (for continuous variables), "
"the ordinal Markov random field, for ordinal (and binary) variables "
"including Blume-Capel parameterizations when the ordinal variables with more "
"than two categories have a meaningful neutral category,\n"
"\t\tas well as a mixed graphical model of continuous and ordinal (Blume-"
"Capel) variables.\n"
msgstr ""
"Modul mendukung model grafikal Gauss (untuk variabel berkelanjutan), kolom "
"acak Markov ordinal, untuk variabel ordinal (dan biner) menyertakan "
"parameterisasi Blume-Capel ketika variabel ordinal dengan lebih dari dua "
"kategori memiliki kategori netral bermanfaat,\n"
"\t\tserta model grafikal bercampur dari variabel berkelanjutan dan ordinal "
"(Blume-Capel).\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When a grouping factor variable is supplied, one network is estimated per "
"group. A a statistical comparison of network differences is available if all "
"selected variables are ordinal or Blume-Capel; otherwise, only group-"
"specific networks are estimated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketika faktor penggrupan disediakan, satu jaringan diestimasikan per grup. "
"Perbandingan statistikal a dari perbedaan jaringan tersedia jika semua "
"variabel terpilih adalah ordinal atau Blume-Capel; jika tidak, hanya "
"jaringan spesifik grup diestimasikan.\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Posterior summaries include the edge weight estimates, along with the edge "
"inclusion probabilities and inclusion Bayes factors, that can be inspected "
"using the different tables and plots.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ringkasan posterior menyertakan estimasi berat tepi, bersamaan dengan "
"probabilitas inklusi tepi dan faktor Bayes inklusi, yang dapat diselidiki "
"menggunakan tabel dan diagram berbeda.\n"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "Asumsi"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables are measured on a single occasion (no time dependency is modeled)."
msgstr ""
"Variabel diukur pada kejadian tunggal (tidak ada dependensi waktu dimodelkan)"
"."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Continuous variables are assumed to follow a Gaussian distribution."
msgstr "Variabel berkelanjutan diasumsikan untuk mengikuti distribusi Gauss."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Ordinal variables are treated as ordered-categorical; select Blume-Capel if "
"a neutral category is meaningful."
msgstr ""
"Variabel ordinal diperlakukan sebagai kategorikal berurut; pilih Blume-Capel "
"jika kategori netral bermanfaat."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Cases with missing values are excluded listwise."
msgstr "Kasus dengan nilai hilang dikecualikan berdaftar."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Variables available for inclusion in the network model."
msgstr "Variabel tersedia untuk inklusi di model jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to include as nodes in the network. Continuous (scale) and "
"ordinal variables are accepted. When a grouping variable is present, a "
"difference network is estimated only if all selected variables are ordinal "
"or Blume-Capel; otherwise separate group networks are estimated."
msgstr ""
"Pilih variabel untuk disertakan sebagai simpul di jaringan. Variabel "
"berkelanjutan (skala) dan ordinal diterima. Ketika variabel penggrupan ada, "
"jaringan perbedaan diestimasikan hanya jika semua variabel terpilih adalah "
"ordinal atau Blume-Capel; jika tidak jaringan grup terpisah diestimasikan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Blume-Capel / Baseline category"
msgstr "Blume-Capel / Kategori dasar"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "B-C"
msgstr "B-C"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Treat this ordinal variable using the Blume-Capel parameterization in the "
"OMRF model. Use this when the variable has a meaningful neutral or reference "
"category (e.g., a symmetric Likert scale with a midpoint)."
msgstr ""
"Perlakukan variabel ordinal ini menggunakan parameterisasi Blume-Capel di "
"model OMRF. Gunakan ini ketika variabel memiliki kategori netral atau "
"referensi bermanfaat (cth., skala Likert simetris dengan titik tengah)."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Baseline"
msgstr "Garis dasar"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the neutral or reference category for the Blume-Capel "
"parameterization. Distances between ordinal categories are measured relative "
"to this baseline."
msgstr ""
"Pilih kategori netral atau referensi untuk parameterisasi Blume-Capel. Jarak "
"antara kategori ordinal diukur relatif dengan dasar ini."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare networks across groups"
msgstr "Bandingkan jaringan seluruh grup"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a nominal variable to estimate one network per group. A difference "
"network is estimated only when all selected variables are ordinal or Blume-"
"Capel; if scale variables are included, only separate group networks are "
"estimated. At least 2 groups and 3 observations per group are required."
msgstr ""
"Pilih variabel nominal untku mengestimasi satu jaringan per grup. Jaringan "
"perbedaan diestimasikan hanya ketika semua variabel terpilih adalah ordinal "
"atau Blume-Capel; jika variabel skala disertakan, hanya jaringan grup "
"terpisah diestimasi. Setidaknya 2 grup dan 3 observasi per grup diperlukan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the posterior mean partial association network. Edge width and "
"color saturation reflect association strength; blue edges are positive and "
"red edges are negative. Edges whose BF₁₀ falls below the inclusion threshold "
"are hidden. Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan jaringan asosiasi parsial rerata posterior. Lebar tepi dan "
"saturasi warna merefleksikan kekuatan asosiasi; tepi biru adalah positif dan "
"tepi merah adalah negatif. Tepi yang BF₁₀ terletak di bawah ambang batas "
"inklusi disembunyikan. Hanya tersedia ketika tidak ada variabel penggrupan "
"dipilih."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Edges with BF₁₀ below this value are set to zero in the network plot."
msgstr "Tepi dengan BF₁₀ di bawah nilai ini diatur ke nol di diagram jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the network with edges colored by the evidence category they belong "
"to. Blue edges have BF₁₀ at or above the threshold (evidence for inclusion); "
"yellow edges have BF₁₀ at or below the reciprocal threshold (evidence for "
"exclusion); gray edges fall in between (absence of evidence)."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan jaringan dengan tepi diwarnai oleh kategori bukti tempat mereka "
"berada. Tepi biru memiliki BF₁₀ di atau di atas ambang batas (bukti untuk "
"inklusi); tepi kuning memiliki BF₁₀ di atau di bawah ambang batas kebalikan "
"(bukti untuk eksklusi); tepi abu-abu berada di antara (absensi dari bukti)."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"BF threshold for categorizing evidence. An edge is evidence for inclusion if "
"BF₁₀ ≥ threshold, evidence for exclusion if BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold, and absence "
"of evidence otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Ambang batas BF untuk mengkategorisasi bukti. Tepi adalah bukti untuk "
"inklusi jika BF₁₀ ≥ ambang batas, bukti untuk eksklusi jika BF₁₀ ≤ 1/ambang "
"batas, dan jika tidak absensi dari bukti."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges with BF₁₀ ≥ threshold, colored blue."
msgstr "Tampilkan tepi dengan BF₁₀ ≥ ambang batas, berwarna biru."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges with BF₁₀ ≤ 1/threshold, colored yellow."
msgstr "Tampilkan tepi dengan BF₁₀ ≤ 1/ambang batas, berwarna kuning."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show edges where BF₁₀ falls between the two thresholds, colored gray."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan tepi di mana BF₁₀ terletak antara dua ambang batas, berwarna abu-"
"abu."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays posterior mean centrality for the selected measures (betweenness, "
"closeness, strength, expected influence). Measures are plotted side by side "
"per node. Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan kepusatan rerata posterior untuk pengukuran terpilih "
"(perantaraan, kedekatan, kekuatan, pengaruh terharap). Pengukuran "
"didiagramkan berdampingan per simpul. Hanya tersedia ketika tidak ada "
"variabel penggrupan dipilih."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Adds 95% highest density intervals (HDI) to centrality summaries."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan 95% interval kepadatan tertinggi (HDI) ke ringkasan kepusatan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Parameter HDI plot"
msgstr "Diagram HDI parameter"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays the posterior mean and highest density interval (HDI) for every "
"pairwise partial association, ordered from smallest to largest posterior "
"mean. One panel per network is shown when multiple networks are estimated. "
"Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan rerata posterior dan interval kepadatan tertinggi (HDI) untuk "
"setiap asosiasi parsial berpasangan, diurutkan dari rerata posterior "
"terkecil hingga terbesar. Satu panel per jaringan ditampilkan ketika "
"beberapa jaringan diestimasi. Hanya tersedia ketika tidak ada variabel "
"penggrupan dipilih."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "HDI coverage:"
msgstr "Cakupan HDI:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Coverage of the highest density interval (e.g., 0.95 for a 95% HDI)."
msgstr "Cakupan dari interval kepadatan tertinggi (cth., 0.95 untuk 95% HDI)."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays a heatmap where each cell shows the posterior proportion of the "
"corresponding pairs of nodes belonging to the same cluster. Only available "
"with the Stochastic block model edge prior (see Prior Specification) and no "
"grouping variable."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan heatmap di mana setiap sel menampilkan proporsi posterior dari "
"pasangan simpul sesuai bersamaan dengan klaster sama. Hanya tersedia dengan "
"priori tepi model blok Stochast (lihat Spesifikasi Priori) dan tidak ada "
"variabel penggrupan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plots the posterior probability of each sampled graph structure (y-axis) "
"against a structure index (x-axis), sorted in decreasing order of "
"probability. Useful for assessing whether a single graph structure dominates "
"the posterior."
msgstr ""
"Mendiagramkan probabilitas posterior dari setiap struktur grafik tersampel "
"(sumbu-y) terhadap indeks struktur (sumbu-x), disortir dalam urutan turun "
"dari probabilitas. Bermanfaat untuk mengevaluasi apakah struktur grafik "
"tunggal mendominasikan posterior."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plots the summed posterior probability (y-axis) against the number of edges "
"(x-axis). Useful for assessing which network complexities are most supported "
"by the data."
msgstr ""
"Mendiagramkan probabilitas posterior berjumlah (sumbu-y) terhadap jumlah "
"tepi (sumbu-x). Bermanfaat untuk mengevaluasi kompleksitas jaringan mana "
"paling didukung oleh data."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows one row per edge. Columns include posterior estimates, inclusion "
"probability, inclusion Bayes factor, and convergence statistics (R-hat). "
"Edges are listed in order of decreasing inclusion probability."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan satu baris per tepi. Kolom menyertakan estimasi posterior, "
"probabilitas inklusi, faktor Bayes inklusi, dan statistik konvergensi (R-hat)"
". Tepi didaftar dalam urutan menurun probabilitas inklusi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Only edges with BF₁₀ above this value are listed in the edge-specific "
"overview table."
msgstr ""
"Hanya tepi dengan BF₁₀ di atas nilai ini didaftar di tabel ikhtisar spesifik "
"tepi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Show estimates on interpretative scale"
msgstr "Tampilkan estimasi pada skala interpretatif"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shows log-odds, precisions, and partial correlations when available."
msgstr "Menampilkan log-ganjil, presisi, dan korelasi parsial ketika tersedia."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Displays a symmetric matrix of edge-wise evidence values. All edges are "
"listed regardless of evidence strength."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan matriks simetris dari nilai bukti bertepi. Semua tepi didaftar "
"terlepas dari kekuatan bukti."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose which evidence quantity to display for each edge."
msgstr "Pilih kuantitas bukti akan ditampilkan untuk setiap tepi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Posterior probability that an edge is present, ranging from 0 (no evidence "
"for the edge) to 1 (certain inclusion)."
msgstr ""
"Probabilitas posterior bahwa tepi ditampilkan, rentang dari 0 (tidak ada "
"bukti untuk tepi) ke 1 (inklusi tertentu)."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor quantifying evidence for edge inclusion relative to exclusion. "
"BF₁₀ > 1 favors inclusion; BF₁₀ < 1 favors exclusion."
msgstr ""
"Faktor Bayes mengukur bukti untuk inklusi tepi relatif dengan eksklusi. BF₁"
"₀ > 1 mendukung inklusi; BF₁₀ < 1 mendukung eksklusi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Reciprocal Bayes factor quantifying evidence for edge exclusion relative to "
"inclusion. BF₀₁ = 1 / BF₁₀."
msgstr ""
"Faktor Bayes timbal balik mengukur kekuatan bukti untuk eksklusi tepi "
"relatif dengan inklusi. BF₀₁ = 1 / BF₁₀."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Natural logarithm of BF₁₀."
msgstr "Logaritma alami dari BF₁₀."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows the posterior mean betweenness, closeness, strength, and expected "
"influence for each node. Centrality is computed on the posterior mean "
"network. Only available when no grouping variable is selected."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan rerata posterior perantaraan, kedekatan, kekuatan, dan pengaruh "
"terharap untuk setiap simpul. Kepusatan dihitung pada jaringan rerata "
"posterior. Hanya tersedia ketika tidak ada variabel penggrupan dipilih."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Shows the estimated cluster membership for each node. The allocation is "
"summarized as either the posterior mean or posterior mode of the cluster "
"indicator across MCMC samples."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan keanggotaan klaster terestimasi untuk setiap simpul. Alokasi "
"diringkaskan sebagai baik rerata posterior atau mode posterior dari indektor "
"klaster seluruh sampel MCMC."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Posterior mean uses the average cluster index across samples (may be non-"
"integer). Posterior mode uses the most frequently sampled cluster assignment."
msgstr ""
"Rerata posterior menggunakan indeks klaster rata-rata seluruh sampel "
"(mungkin non-integer). Model posterior menggunakan penugasan klaster "
"bersampel paling sering."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shows the posterior probability for every possible number of clusters."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan probabilitas posterior untuk setiap jumlah klaster memungkinkan.."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Computes a Bayes factor comparing hypotheses about the clustering structure."
msgstr ""
"Menghitung faktor Bayes membandingkan hipotesis tentang struktur klaster."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Clustering vs. no clustering compares the hypothesis of multi-cluster "
"solution against a the hypothesis of a single-cluster (no clustering) model. "
"Point hypotheses compares two specific numbers of clusters."
msgstr ""
"Klaster vs. tidak berklaster membandingkan hipotesis dari solusi multi-"
"klaster terhadap a hipotesis dari model klaster tunggal (tidak berklaster). "
"Hipotesis titik membandingkan dua jumlah klaster spesifik."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The BF tests whether any clustered structure is more probable than a single-"
"cluster network."
msgstr ""
"BF menguji apakah struktur berklaster apa pun lebih memungkinkan dari "
"jaringan klaster tunggal."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The BF compares the posterior probability of exactly H₁ clusters versus "
"exactly H₂ clusters."
msgstr ""
"BF membandingkan probabilitas posterior dari klaster H₁ secara tepat versus "
"klaster H₂ secara tepat."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of clusters under hypothesis H₁."
msgstr "Jumlah klaster di bawah hipotesis H₁."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of clusters under hypothesis H₂."
msgstr "Jumlah klaster di bawah hipotesis H₂."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bernoulli: each edge is independently included with a fixed prior "
"probability. Beta-binomial: edges share a random inclusion probability drawn "
"from a Beta distribution, allowing borrowing of information. Stochastic "
"block: inclusion probabilities depend on latent cluster membership, with "
"separate within- and between-cluster parameters. The Stochastic block option "
"is only available without a grouping variable."
msgstr ""
"Bernoulli: setiap tepi secara independen disertakan dengan probabilitas "
"priori tetap. Binomial-beta: tepi membagikan probabilitas inklusi acak "
"digambarkan dari distribusi Beta, mengizinkan meminjam dari informasi. Blok "
"Stochast: probabilitas inklusi bergantung pada keanggotaan klaster laten, "
"dengan parameter dalam dan antara klaster terpisah. Opsi blok Stochast hanya "
"tersedia tanpa variabel penggrupan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Prior probability that any given edge is present under the Bernoulli prior. "
"The default of 0.5 assigns equal prior probability to inclusion and "
"exclusion. Values closer to 0 impose a sparser prior."
msgstr ""
"Probabilitas priori yang tepi diberikan apa pun ditampilkan di bawah priori "
"Bernoulli. Bawaan dari 0.5 menugaskan probabilitas priori sama ke inklusi "
"dan ekslusi. Nilai lebih dekat dengan 0 memaksakan priori lebih jarang."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 1:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta prior on the within-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability. Together with shape parameter 2, controls the prior "
"mean (α1 / (α1 + α2)) and concentration. Equal values of 1 correspond to a "
"uniform prior within each cluster."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk pertama (α1) dari priori Beta pada probabilitas inklusi "
"tepi dalam klaster. Samakan dengan parameter bentuk 2, mengontrol rerata "
"priori (α1 / (α1 + α2)) dan konsentrasi. Nilai sama dari 1 sesuai dengan "
"priori keseragaman dalam setiap klaster."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 2:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta prior on the within-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability. Equal values of 1 correspond to a uniform prior."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk kedua (α2) dari priori Beta pada probabilitas inklusi tepi "
"dalam klaster. Nilai sama dari 1 sesuai dengan priori keseragaman."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta prior on the between-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability. To encourage sparsity between clusters (block "
"structure), set both between-cluster parameters to values less than 1."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk pertama (α1) dari priori Beta pada probabilitas inklusi "
"tepi antara klaster. Untuk menganjurkan kelangkaan antara klaster (struktur "
"blok), atur kedua parameter antara klater ke nilai kurang dari 1."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta prior on the between-cluster edge "
"inclusion probability."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk kedua (α2) dari priori Beta pada probabilitas inklusi tepi "
"antara klaster."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Rate parameter of the truncated Poisson prior on the number of clusters. "
"Smaller values favor fewer clusters."
msgstr ""
"Parameter nilai dari priori Poisson bertrunkasi pada jumlah klaster. Nilai "
"lebih kecil mendukung klaster lebih sedikit."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Symmetric Dirichlet concentration parameter for cluster membership "
"probabilities. The default of 1 is roughly uninformative about cluster "
"sizes. Values less than 1 favor unequal cluster sizes."
msgstr ""
"Parameter konsentrasi Dirichlet simetris untuk probabilitas keanggotaan "
"klaster. Bawaan dari 1 tidak informatif secara kasar tentang ukuran klaster. "
"Nilai kurang dari 1 mendukung ukuran klaster tidak sama."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the partial association differences:"
msgstr "Keluarga priori untuk perbedaan asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "Keluarga priori untuk parameter asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Family of the prior on the partial association parameters. Cauchy is the "
"default heavy-tailed shrinkage prior. Normal applies lighter-tailed "
"shrinkage. Beta-prime is parameterized via two shape parameters on the "
"logistic scale."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga dari priori pada parameter asosiasi parsial. Cauchy adalahh priori "
"penyusutan berekor berat bawaan. Normal menerapkan penyusutan berekor "
"ringan. Prima-Beta diparameterisasi melalui dua parameter bentuk pada skala "
"logistik."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Cauchy"
msgstr "Cauchy"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Beta-prime"
msgstr "Prima-Beta"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Normal distribution for the differences:"
msgstr "Skala dari distribusi Normal untuk perbedaan:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the differences:"
msgstr "Skala dari distribusi Cauchy untuk perbedaan:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Normal distribution for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "Skala distribusi Normal untuk parameter asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "Skala distribusi Cauchy untuk parameter asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale parameter of the Cauchy or Normal prior on the partial association "
"parameters. When a grouping variable is selected, this scale applies to the "
"differences between groups."
msgstr ""
"Parameter skala dari priori Cauchy atau Normal pada parameter asosiasi "
"parsial. Ketika variabel penggrupan dipilih, skala ini diterapkan ke "
"perbedaan antara grup."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1 for the partial associations:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 1 untuk asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta-prime prior on the partial "
"association parameters."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk pertama (α1) dari priori prima-Beta pada parameter asosiasi "
"parsial."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2 for the partial associations:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 2 untuk asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta-prime prior on the partial "
"association parameters."
msgstr ""
"Parameter bentuk kedua (α2) dari priori prima-Beta pada parameter asosiasi "
"parsial."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Baseline Cauchy scale for the partial association parameters:"
msgstr "Skala Cauchy dasar untuk parameter asosiasi parsial:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Scale of the Cauchy prior on the *baseline* partial association parameters "
"when comparing groups. Set to a positive value to override the default of 1; "
"values ≤ 0 fall back to the differences scale."
msgstr ""
"Skala dari priori Cauchy pada parameter asosiasi parsial *dasar* ketika "
"membandingkan grup. Atur ke nilai positif untuk menimpa bawaan dari 1; nilai "
"≤ 0 dikembalikan ke skala perbedaan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior family for the main effects:"
msgstr "Keluarga priori untuk efek utama:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Family of the prior on the main effects (thresholds). Beta-prime is the "
"default; Cauchy and Normal are alternative parameterizations on the original "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga dari priori pada efek utama (ambang batas). Prima-Beta adalah "
"bawaan; Cauchy dan Normal adlah parameterisasi alternatif pada skala asli."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 1 for the main effects:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 1 untuk efek utama:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "First shape parameter (α1) of the Beta-prime prior on the main effects."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk pertama (α1) dari priori prima-Beta pada efek utama."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Shape parameter 2 for the main effects:"
msgstr "Parameter bentuk 2 untuk efek utama:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Second shape parameter (α2) of the Beta-prime prior on the main effects."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk kedua (α2) dari priori prima-Beta pada efek utama."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Normal distribution for the main effects:"
msgstr "Skala dari distribusi Normal untuk efek utama:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale of the Cauchy distribution for the main effects:"
msgstr "Skala dari distribusi Cauchy untuk efek utama:"

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale parameter of the Cauchy or Normal prior on the main effects."
msgstr "Parameter skala dari priori Cauchy atau Normal pada efek utama."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of warmup iterations discarded from the start of each chain to allow "
"the Markov chain to converge before collecting posterior samples."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah iterasi pemanasan dibuan dari awal setiap rantai untuk mengizinkan "
"rantai Markov untuk mengonvergensi sebelum mengumpulkan sampel posterior."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Total number of MCMC iterations per chain, including the burn-in. Posterior "
"inference uses the iterations after burn-in. Increase for more stable "
"estimates, especially for complex models."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah total iterasi MCMC per rantai, termasuk burn-in. Inferensi posterior "
"menggunakan iterasi setelah burn-in. Tingkatkan untuk estimasi lebih stabil, "
"terutama untuk model kompleks."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of independent MCMC chains. With 2 or more chains, the Gelman-Rubin R-"
"hat convergence statistic is computed across all chains. With 1 chain, a "
"split-chain version is used instead. R-hat values above approximately 1.05 "
"suggest the chains have not converged."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah rantai MCMC independen. Dengan 2 atau lebih rantai, statistik "
"konvergensi R-hat Gelman-Rubin dihitung di semua rantai. Dengan 1 rantai, "
"versi terpisah rantai digunakan sebagai pengganti. Nilai R-hat di atas "
"perkiraan 1.05 menyarankan rantai tidak dikonvergensi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "MCMC algorithm used to sample from the posterior."
msgstr "Algoritma MCMC digunakan untuk menyampelkan dari posterior."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define named groups for manual node coloring. Each group can be assigned a "
"color that will appear in the network plot when Manual colors is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Definisikan grup bernama untuk pewarnaan simpul manual. Setiap grup dapat "
"menugaskan warna yang akan muncul di diagram jaringan ketika warna Manual "
"diaktifkan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Assign each network variable to one of the color groups defined on the left. "
"All variables start in Group 1 by default."
msgstr ""
"Tugaskan setipa variabel jaringan ke salah satu dari grup warna "
"didefinisikan ke kiri. Semua variabel memulai di Grup 1 secara bawaan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When enabled, node colors are taken from the group color assignments above. "
"When disabled, a predefined palette is applied uniformly."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diaktifkan, warna simpul diambil dari penugasan warna grup di atas. "
"Ketika dinonaktifkan, palet di-pradefinisi diterapkan secara keseragaman."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Color palette applied to node groups when Manual colors is disabled. "
"Colorblind-safe options are recommended for accessible figures."
msgstr ""
"Palet warna diterapkan ke grup simpul ketika warna Manual dinonaktifkan. "
"Opsi ramah warna buta direkomendasikan untuk figur dapat diakses."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to all node sizes. A value of 1 uses the default size; "
"values above 1 create larger nodes."
msgstr ""
"Pengkali diterapkan ke semua ukuran simpul. Nilai dari 1 menggunakan ukuran "
"bawaan; nilai di atas 1 membuat simpul lebih besar."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier applied to all edge widths. A value of 2 doubles the edge width "
"relative to the default."
msgstr ""
"Pengkali diterapkan ke semua lebar tepi. Nilai dari 2 menggandakan lebar "
"tepi relatif terhadap bawaan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sets the edge weight that corresponds to the maximum line width. Edges "
"stronger than this value are clipped to the maximum width. Set to 0 to scale "
"all edges relative to the strongest edge."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur berat tepi yang sesuai dengan lebar garis maksimum. Tepi lebih kuat "
"dari nilai ini diklip ke lebar maksimum. Atur ke 0 untuk menskalakan semua "
"tepi relatif terhadap tepi terkuat."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Edges with absolute weight below this value are hidden in the network plot. "
"If the threshold exceeds the strongest edge, it is ignored and a warning is "
"shown in the summary table."
msgstr ""
"Tepi dengan berat absolut di bawah nilai ini disembunyikan di diagram "
"jaringan. Jika ambang batas melampaui tepi terkuat, itu diabaikan dan "
"peringatan ditampilkan di tabel ringkasan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Edges with absolute weight below this value are drawn thin and desaturated; "
"above it they scale to full width and saturation. Set to 0 to scale all "
"edges continuously without a cut threshold."
msgstr ""
"Tepi dengan berat absolut di bawah nilai ini digambarkan tipis dan tidak "
"berjenuh; di atasnya mereka diskalakan hingga lebar dan jenuh penuh. Atur ke "
"0 untuk menskalalakn semua tepi secara lanjut tanpa ambang batas pemotongan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Overlays the minimum edge strength, maximum edge strength, and cut values as "
"text on the network plot."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan kekuatan tepi minimum, kekuatan tepi maksimum, dan nilai potong "
"sebagai teks pada diagram jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Overlay the numerical edge weight on each edge in the network plot."
msgstr "Tampilkan berat tepi numerik pada setiap tepi di diagram jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Multiplier for edge label size."
msgstr "Pengkali untuk ukuran label tepi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Position of edge labels along each edge (0 to 1)."
msgstr "Posisi label tepi sepanjang setiap tepi (0 ke 1)."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Color scheme applied to positive and negative edges. Classic uses blue for "
"positive and red for negative associations. Colorblind-safe and grayscale "
"options are also available."
msgstr ""
"Skema warna diterapkan ke tepi positif dan negatif. Klasik menggunakan biru "
"untuk positif dan merah untuk asosiasi negatif. Opsi ramah warna buta dan "
"skala abu-abu juga tersedia."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Multiplier for node label font size. A value of 2 doubles the label size "
"relative to the default."
msgstr ""
"Pengkali untuk ukuran huruf label simpul. Nilai dari 2 menggandakan relatif "
"ukuran label terhadap bawaan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When enabled, label font size is automatically scaled relative to node size "
"so that labels fit inside nodes."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diaktifkan, ukuran huruf label secara otomatis diskalakan relatif ke "
"ukuran simpul sehingga label itu sesuai dalam simpul."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Abbreviate variable names in plots to reduce label clutter."
msgstr "Singkatkan nama variabel di diagram untuk mengurangi kekacauan label."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Target character length for abbreviated labels."
msgstr "Targertkan panjang karakter untuk label bersingka."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose where variable names are displayed in network plots."
msgstr "Pilih nama variabel mana ditampilkan di diagram jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable names are shown as labels directly on the nodes."
msgstr "Nama variabel ditampilkan sebagai label secara langsung pada simpul."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are labeled with numbers; a legend maps each number to the variable "
"name. Useful when variable names are long."
msgstr ""
"Simpul dilabeli dengan angka; legenda memetakan setiap angka ke nama "
"variabel. Bermanfaat ketika nama variabel panjang."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Controls legend placement across network plots. When multiple networks are "
"shown (e.g., with grouping), this setting applies globally."
msgstr ""
"Mengontrol penempatan legenda seluruh diagram jaringan. Ketika beberapa "
"jaringan ditampilkan (cth., dengan penggrupan), pengaturan ini menerapkan "
"secara global."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "No legend is shown in any plot."
msgstr "Tidak ada legenda ditampilkan di diagram apa pun."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "A legend is added to every network plot."
msgstr "Legenda ditambahkan ke setiap diagram jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"A legend is added to only the plot with the specified number, and other "
"plots are shown without a legend."
msgstr ""
"Legenda ditambahkan hanya ke diagram dengan angka ditentukan, dan diagram "
"lain ditampilkan tanpa legenda."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid "1-based index of the plot in which the legend should appear."
msgstr "Indeks berbasis 1 dari diagram di mana legenda harus muncul."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Width of the legend panel relative to the network plot. A value of 0.4 means "
"the legend is 40% as wide as the plot."
msgstr ""
"Lebar dari panel legenda relatif ke diagram jaringan. Nilai dari 0.4 artinya "
"legenda 40% as dari lebar grafik."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Determines how nodes are positioned in network plots. The same layout is "
"applied to all networks in a multi-network analysis, computed from the "
"average of estimated edge weights."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan bagaimana simpul diposisikan di diagram jaringan. Tata letak sama "
"diterapkan ke semua jaringan di analisis multi-jaringan, dihitung dari rata-"
"rata dari berat tepi terestimasi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are positioned using the Fruchterman-Reingold force-directed "
"algorithm. Strongly connected nodes are placed closer together."
msgstr ""
"Simpul diposisikan menggunakan algoritma diarahkan pemaksaan Fruchterman-"
"Reingold. Simpul tersambung dengan kuat ditempatkan lebih berdekatan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Controls how strongly nodes repel each other. Larger values spread nodes "
"further apart."
msgstr ""
"Mengontrol seberapa kuat simpul salin tolak-menolak. Nilai lebih tinggu "
"tersebar lebih jauh sama lain."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Nodes are evenly spaced on a circle. Useful for comparing relative edge "
"patterns without the layout reflecting association strength."
msgstr ""
"Simpul tersebar secara merata pada lingkaran. Bermanfaat untuk membandingkan "
"pola tepi relatif tanpa tata letak merefleksikan kekuatan asosiasi."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of shortest paths between other node pairs that pass through this "
"node. Nodes with high betweenness act as bridges in the network."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah jalur terpendek antara pasangan simpul lain yang melewati simpul ini. "
"Simpul dengan perantaraan tertinggi bertindak sebagai jembatan di jaringan."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Inverse of the average shortest path length from this node to all other "
"nodes. Nodes with high closeness can efficiently reach all other nodes."
msgstr ""
"Invers dari panjang jalur terpendek rata-rata dari simpul ini ke semua "
"simpul lain. Simpul dengan kedekatan tinggi dapat mencapai semua simpul lain "
"secara efisien."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sum of absolute edge weights connected to this node. Reflects how strongly a "
"node is associated with its neighbors."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah berat tepi absolut disambungkan ke simpul ini. Merefleksikan seberapa "
"kuat node diasosiasikan dengan tetangganya."

msgctxt "BayesianNetworkAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Sum of signed edge weights connected to this node. Unlike strength, negative "
"edges reduce the value, so nodes with mixed positive and negative "
"connections may have low expected influence."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah berat tepi bertanda disambungkan ke simpul ini. Tidak seperti "
"kekuatan, tepi negatif mengurangi nilai, sehingga simpul dengan sambungan "
"positif dan negatif bercampur mungkin memiliki pengaruh terharap rendah."
